D01/02/2024
NXIn
T20000.00
PTransfer from checking
L[Checking]
^
D02/01/2024
NBuy
YVanguard Total Stock Mkt Idx
I100.00
Q100
T10000.00
^
D06/30/2024
NReinvDiv
YVanguard Total Stock Mkt Idx
I100.00
Q2.5
T250.00
^
"""
