!Option:AutoSwitch
!Account
NChecking
TBank
^
NKen Roth IRA
TInvst
^
!Clear:AutoSwitch
!Account
NChecking
TBank
^
!Type:Bank
D4/15'24
T-6000.00
PVanguard
L[Ken Roth IRA]
^
