When qif file imported
Then accounts created are : ChartOfAccounts CompareOnly
| Path                  |
| Assets:Checking       |
| Assets:Ken Roth IRA   |
Then postings are : PostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Payee    | Account             | Amount   |
| T1  | 2024-04-15 | Vanguard | Assets:Checking     | -6000.00 |
| T1  | 2024-04-15 | Vanguard | Assets:Ken Roth IRA | 6000.00  |
When report run : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Category   |
| From     | 2024-01-01 |
| To       | 2024-12-31 |
| Interval | Whole      |
Then report rows are : ReportRow
| Account | Level | Amount | IsSubtotal |
# No rows. Both accounts are real, so the transfer touches no category and the
# six thousand is not spending. This is the figure the nineteen records would
# otherwise have added to Uncategorized.

