Then postings are : PostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Payee    | Account           | Amount   |
| T1  | 2026-01-20 | A Client | Assets:Checking   | 2500.00  |
| T1  | 2026-01-20 | A Client | Income:Consulting | -2500.00 |
# One transaction, dated when the money arrived. Assets:Customer Invoices is
# never posted to: on a cash basis there is no receivable to carry.
When report run : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Category   |
| From     | 2025-01-01 |
| To       | 2025-12-31 |
| Interval | Whole      |
Then report rows are : ReportRow
| Account | Level | Amount | IsSubtotal |
# No rows in 2025: the income is in 2026.

