# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The unpaid invoices, in the migration report
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Scenario An unpaid invoice posts nothing and is listed in full
Description On a cash basis an invoice never paid is never income, so it posts
Description nothing at all. It is listed with its date, payee, amount and
Description categories, because it is the difference between what was invoiced
Description and what was earned, and it is the only place that difference is
Description visible.
