Scenario Invoicing was used in two spells, and the report says so
Description 180 of the 212 invoices fall between 2006 and 2011, none at all
Description between 2012 and 2016, and 32 from 2017 onwards. The gap is not a
Description fault: the practice changed to banking the money against its
Description category directly. Saying so in the report stops the gap being
Description read as missing data.
